     "body": "<p>As of <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/93a8e636ab22559a9100eedea20f83f8bb9077d6\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/93a8e636ab22559a9100eedea20f83f8bb9077d6</a></p>\n\n<p>the command</p>\n\n<p><tt>&gt; curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPATCH -H\"Content-type: application/sparql-update\" -d \"DELETE { &lt;&gt; unknown:title \\\"A Title\\\" . } INSERT { &lt;&gt; unknown:title \\\"new title\\\" . } WHERE { }\" <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test</a></tt></p>\n\n<p>returns</p>\n\n<p><tt>HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request</tt><br/>\n<tt>Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2020 21:22:14 GMT</tt><br/>\n<tt>Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=node01pkktvh2b9jzq1j1h2ayhm9v8p3.node0; Path=/</tt><br/>\n<tt>Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT</tt><br/>\n<tt>Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Thu, 12-Nov-2020 21:22:14 GMT; SameSite=lax</tt><br/>\n<tt>Content-Type: text/plain;charset=utf-8</tt><br/>\n<tt>Content-Length: 114</tt><br/>\n<tt>Server: Jetty(9.4.34.v20201102)</tt><tt>There are one or more undefined namespace(s) in your request [ unknown:title ], please define them before retrying</tt></p>",
